# P57 P45 Token-IS (i45a) Failure Evidence (Commit 26f9f4a2)

`canon-p57-fl-is-i45a-26f9f4a2` ran Step 0 Rollout and Pre-backward Alignment with Warning successfully.
However, in post_backward `alignment.check_batch()`, it failed because `CANON_ENGINE_MODULE_C!=1`:

```text
[rank0]:   File "/app/tunix/rl/rl_cluster.py", line 900, in update_actor
