In Stock IS mode (`regime=stock-fast, arm=is`), `CANON_ENGINE_MODULE_C` is 0 by design (observer-only). `check_batch` needs to recognize `p57_arm == "is"` and not require `CANON_ENGINE_MODULE_C==1`.
